@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Digidoclocker)

[*] --> Registration

state Registration
Registration : entry / Get the Registration Details

state UserType <<choice>>
UserType --> CitizenLogin : [Citizen]
UserType --> RegistrarRequest : [Registrar]

state CitizenLogin
CitizenLogin : entry / Enter Login Details

state CitizenLoggedin
CitizenLoggedin : entry / User Logged In

state DocumentUpload
DocumentUpload : entry / Upload Documents

state ProfileView
ProfileView : entry / View Profile

state CertificateApply
CertificateApply : entry / Apply for Certificates

state MultipleCertificates
MultipleCertificates : entry / Continue Applying for More Certificates

state RegistrarRequest
RegistrarRequest : entry / Request Certificates for Verification

state RegistrarRequests
RegistrarRequests : entry / Continue Requesting Certificates

state SessionEnd
SessionEnd : entry / End Session

CitizenLoggedin --> DocumentUpload
CitizenLoggedin --> ProfileView
CitizenLoggedin --> CertificateApply

DocumentUpload --> MultipleCertificates

CertificateApply --> MultipleCertificates

RegistrarRequest --> RegistrarRequests

CitizenLogin --> CitizenLoggedin

UserType --> CitizenLogin

SessionEnd --> [*]

@enduml
